[h2][b]Changelog[/b][/h2]

[h2][1.02] - 2026-10-20[/h2]
[list]
[*] Added
[list]
[*] Options menu warning for an extension in a [b]ws_<number>[/b] folder that the game does not manage as a Workshop subscription.
[*] Options menu warning for the same extension id installed in more than one folder.
[/list]
[*] Changed
[list]
[*] Report lines are written as plain [b][General][/b] info lines, without the [b]=====[/b] separators and the [b]=ERROR=[/b] tag.
[/list]
[/list]
[h2][1.01] - 2026-07-31[/h2]
[list]
[*] Added
[list]
[*] Current screen resolution to the [b]Game Data[/b] section of the report.
[*] UI related settings to the [b]Game Data[/b] section: UI scale option, menu width option, both [b]GetUIScale()[/b] variants, Helper view width/height, Helper [b]uiScale[/b], and the [b]Helper.scaleX()[/b]/[b]Helper.scaleY()[/b] results for a 100 pixel reference value.
[/list]
[/list]
